# Awaken the Honored Dead, all three chapters. I (turn 3, as it enters): "Destroy target nonland permanent" - Bot2's Island is
# refused (a land), Bot2's Ornithopter is destroyed. II (turn 5): "Mill three cards" - the Ornithopter, Sol Ring and Forest on top
# of Bot1's library go to its graveyard. III (turn 7): "You may discard a card. When you do, return target creature or land card
# from your graveyard to your hand" - Bot1 discards a Swamp; the reflexive ability's target is chosen as it goes on the stack:
# Sol Ring (neither creature nor land) and the Ornithopter in Bot2's graveyard are refused, Bot1's own milled Ornithopter is
# chosen and returned. After chapter III the Saga is sacrificed (CR 714.4) and sits in the graveyard with the rest.

